@startuml
a -> b
b -> c: data
c -> b: process
b -> a: reply
a -> d: Output
a -> a
@enduml

@startuml
control Pdf2Emb
participant GetDocs
participant PDFReader
participant Model
database ChromaDB

Pdf2Emb -> GetDocs: Get List of PDFs 
GetDocs -> Pdf2Emb: PDFs List
Pdf2Emb -> Pdf2Emb: Go through the each PDF
Pdf2Emb -> PDFReader: Read Text from PDF
PDFReader -> Pdf2Emb: Text
Pdf2Emb -> Model: Text
Model -> ChromaDB: Embeddings
ChromaDB ->Pdf2Emb: Success
Pdf2Emb -> Pdf2Emb: Goto next file
@enduml
